[ti:Sarvottam Stotram]
[ar:Shrimad Vallabhaacharya]
[al:Pushtimarg Kirtan]

[00:00.00]Sarvottam Stotram
[00:05.00]
[00:08.00]Prakurta dharmaana shreyam prakurt nikhil dharm roopmiti
[00:16.00]Nigam prati pandhyam yat-tachundhm saakruti staumi - 1
[00:24.00]
[00:26.00]Kalikaal tamashchan dhrasti tavadvi dhushampi
[00:34.00]Sampratya vishyastasya mahatmayam samabhud bhuvi - 2
[00:42.00]
[00:44.00]Dayaya nij mahatmayam karishyan prakurtm Hari
[00:52.00]Vanya yada tada syasyan pradurbhutam chaakar hi - 3
[01:00.00]
[01:02.00]Tadukatmapi durbodham subodham syadhytha tatha
[01:10.00]Tannamaashtottar shatanm pravkshyamykhilad hrut - 4
[01:18.00]
[01:20.00]Rishiragni kumarstu naamnam chhando jagatyasau
[01:28.00]Shri Krishnasyam Devta cha, bijam karurikah Prabhu - 5
[01:36.00]
[01:38.00]Viniyogo bhaktiyog pratibandh vinashane
[01:46.00]Krishnadharamrataswad sidhiratra na sansheyh - 6
[01:54.00]
[01:56.00]Anandah Parmanandah, Shri Krishna swayam krapanidhihi
[02:04.00]Daivoddhar prayatnatma smrutimatrartinashanah - 7
[02:12.00]
[02:14.00]Shri Bhagvad gudhaarth prakashan parayaanh
[02:22.00]Saakaar brahmhvaadek sthapko vedparagah - 8
[02:30.00]
[02:32.00]Mayavad niraakarta sarva vadiniraaskrut
[02:40.00]Bhaktimargabaj maartand stri shudradhyud dhrutikshum - 9
[02:48.00]
[02:50.00]Angikrutyaiv Gopish vallabhikrut manavah
[02:58.00]Angikrutou samaryado mahakarruniko vibhuh - 10
[03:06.00]
[03:08.00]Adeydan dhaksh shch mahodaarcharitravaan
[03:16.00]Prakurtanukruti vyaj mohita sur manushah - 11
[03:24.00]
[03:26.00]Vaishvanro Vallabhbhakhyah, sadrupo hitkrut staam
[03:34.00]Janshikshakrutteh Krishna bhakti krannikhileshtadah - 12
[03:42.00]
[03:44.00]Sarvalakhshasampanh Shri Krishna gyan-do Guruhu
[03:52.00]Svanandantudilah Padma dalaayat vilochanah - 13
[04:00.00]
[04:02.00]Kripadrag vrashti sanhrast daasdaasipriyah patihi
[04:10.00]Roshdrakpaat samplusht bhaktdweet bhaktsevitah - 14
[04:18.00]
[04:20.00]Sukhsevyo duraradhyo dhurlabbhamghri saroruhah
[04:28.00]Ugrapratapo vaaksidhu puritashesh sevakah - 15
[04:36.00]
[04:38.00]Shri Bhagvatpiyush samudramathankshamah
[04:46.00]Tatsaarbhutaraas stri bhavpurit vigrahah - 16
[04:54.00]
[04:56.00]Saannidhya matra dat shriKrishnaprema vimukh
[05:04.00]Teed Raaslile kataatparia krupye tat kathaprad - 17
[05:12.00]
[05:14.00]Varihanubhave kaart sarva tayago padeshaka
[05:22.00]Bhaktyacharo padeshta cha karmamargpravartak - 18
[05:30.00]
[05:32.00]Yagado bhaktimargek saadhan tavopdeshak
[05:40.00]Purnanand purakaamo vaak patir vibudeshravar - 19
[05:48.00]
[05:50.00]Krishnanaam sahastrasya vaakta bhaktparayan
[05:58.00]Bhaktyacharop deshaart na na vaak nirupak - 20
[06:06.00]
[06:08.00]Swarthojjitaakhilpran priyastadrushveshteed
[06:16.00]Swadasarthkrutashesh saadhan sarvashaktidruka - 21
[06:24.00]
[06:26.00]Bhuvi bhaktipracharakkrute Svanveykrute pitah
[06:34.00]Savvansheystapitaasheshsavmahatmeya samyapah - 22
[06:42.00]
[06:44.00]Pativratapati paar laukikehidhaankrute
[06:52.00]Nigudherdheyo nenyabhakteshu gyapitasheya - 23
[07:00.00]
[07:02.00]Upasnadi margati mughadmohnivarak
[07:10.00]Bhaktimarge sarva-margvey-lakshaad-yaanobuti-krute - 24
[07:18.00]
[07:20.00]Prathaksharanmargopdeshta ShriKrishnahardvita
[07:28.00]Prtishannikunj-jast lilarassupurit - 25
[07:36.00]
[07:38.00]Tatkaathashipathchitasatdh vismrataanyo vrajpriya
[07:46.00]Priyavrajstiti pushti lilakarta raha priya - 26
[07:54.00]
[07:56.00]Bhaktechapurak Sarvaagyaatliloti mohan
[08:04.00]Sarvaasakto bhaktmaatraskut patitpavan - 27
[08:12.00]
[08:14.00]Savyashogaansanharshtha rdeyyanmbhojvishtar
[08:22.00]Yash piyushlahri plavitaanyaras par - 28
[08:30.00]
[08:32.00]Lilamratrasaardhrardhri krutakhil sharirbruteh
[08:40.00]Govardhanstitatyutsaahsa tlilaprempurit - 29
[08:48.00]
[08:50.00]Yaagyabhokta yaagyakarta chaturvarg visharadah
[08:58.00]Satyapratigya strigudatito nayvisharad - 30
[09:06.00]
[09:08.00]Savkirtivardansatatva sutrabhashyapradarshak
[09:16.00]Mayavaad dhakya tulagni brahmavaadnirupak - 31
[09:24.00]
[09:26.00]Aprakurta khilakalpa bhushit sahajasmeet
[09:34.00]Trilokibhushan bhumi bhagyan sahajsunder - 32
[09:42.00]
[09:44.00]Asheshbhaktsanpratarya charanbij rajodhan
[09:52.00]Ityanandnide proktam naamnam mashtotaram shatam - 33
[10:00.00]
[10:02.00]Shradavishudbhudirya Pathatyanudinan jun
[10:10.00]Attadekamna sidhimuktaan prapnotysanshayam - 34
[10:18.00]
[10:20.00]Tad prapto vratha moksha satdapto tadagataarthta
[10:28.00]Ataha sarvotam stotram japyam Krishnarasaarthibi - 35
[10:36.00]
[10:40.00]|| Iti Shrimad Vallabhaacharya virchitam Sarvottam stotram sampoornam ||
